WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:15.130
Zann and his friends careened through the vortex.

2
00:00:15.871 --> 00:00:19.934
They were moving so fast that the passing wormholes all blurred together.

3
00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:23.357
Seconds later they crashed into another world.

4
00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:27.360
There had been no chance of holding onto the edge of the wormhole this time.

5
00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:31.924
Zann felt himself fly at least a dozen yards into the new world.

6
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.942
Splash! "Drat!"

7
00:00:35.182 --> 00:00:36.723
Zann sat up and looked around.

8
00:00:37.463 --> 00:00:40.585
The first thing he saw was the bright blue sky overhead.

9
00:00:41.426 --> 00:00:45.749
Then he noticed a wormhole winking right beside the stream he was sitting in.

10
00:00:46.549 --> 00:00:47.170
That was weird.

11
00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:49.271
How could it still be so close?

12
00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.653
"Zann!" Perda cried.

13
00:00:51.673 --> 00:00:55.235
"Look!" She pointed at some houses nearby.

14
00:00:56.136 --> 00:00:58.077
They were no taller than Zann's knee.

15
00:00:58.097 --> 00:01:00.819
"Yes!" Zann cried.

16
00:01:00.839 --> 00:01:03.284
"We're here—oof!"

17
00:01:03.304 --> 00:01:04.345
He was yanked off his feet.

18
00:01:04.725 --> 00:01:06.346
Mother's spell was still working!

19
00:01:07.107 --> 00:01:13.771
The message stone pulled Zann and the others through the forest at such speed that Zann felt dizzy.

20
00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:15.753
Thump! "Ouch!"

21
00:01:16.193 --> 00:01:18.074
Zann blurted out as he bumped into something.

22
00:01:18.094 --> 00:01:21.917
"Hey!" a disgruntled voice complained.

23
00:01:21.937 --> 00:01:24.459
"Watch where you're going."

24
00:01:25.299 --> 00:01:29.142
Even before the person turned around, Zann knew exactly who it was.

25
00:01:29.162 --> 00:01:31.183
"Wyssa!" He gasped.

26
00:01:33.216 --> 00:01:33.436
"Oh no!"

27
00:01:33.456 --> 00:01:35.377
"What are you kids doing here?"

28
00:01:35.737 --> 00:01:36.457
Wyssa demanded.

29
00:01:36.477 --> 00:01:40.479
"You?" Perda frowned at Wyssa as she brushed herself off.

30
00:01:41.459 --> 00:01:44.301
Zann felt his heart sink as he realized the mistake.

31
00:01:45.661 --> 00:01:51.263
"Mother's magic brought us to the stone's rightful owner—the last person who possessed it."

32
00:01:52.304 --> 00:01:56.125
"Wyssa," Darb said, realization dawning on his face.

33
00:01:57.066 --> 00:01:58.966
Zann nodded, feeling crushed.

34
00:01:58.986 --> 00:02:02.748
"I can't believe I got my hopes up," he mumbled.

35
00:02:03.808 --> 00:02:04.869
"Stupid spell!"

36
00:02:05.349 --> 00:02:06.910
He tossed the message stone away.

37
00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:08.450
Perda grabbed it.

38
00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:10.411
"You should keep the stone.

39
00:02:11.091 --> 00:02:12.492
It could still be a clue."

40
00:02:13.513 --> 00:02:14.293
Zann frowned.

41
00:02:14.693 --> 00:02:16.654
"I never want to see that thing again."

42
00:02:17.815 --> 00:02:20.716
Perda shrugged and tucked the stone into her own pocket.

43
00:02:21.476 --> 00:02:22.917
Wyssa was glaring at all of them.

44
00:02:23.617 --> 00:02:26.999
"Well? Why aren't you kids in Magica?"

45
00:02:27.939 --> 00:02:29.320
Gliss took a step backward.

46
00:02:31.468 --> 00:02:32.529
"Um "Oh, never mind."

47
00:02:32.849 --> 00:02:34.630
Wyssa waved a gnarled hand.

48
00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.511
"I don't care.

49
00:02:36.992 --> 00:02:39.273
The important thing is I've found him!

50
00:02:40.254 --> 00:02:42.976
I've traced Morb to this world!"

51
00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.598
Her eyes glittered angrily.

52
00:02:46.818 --> 00:02:49.240
"Really?" Zann still felt disappointed.

53
00:02:50.041 --> 00:02:52.062
But maybe all hope wasn't lost.

54
00:02:52.642 --> 00:02:53.883
At least they'd found Wyssa.

55
00:02:54.744 --> 00:02:57.766
And if Morb was here, maybe Zann's parents were too.

56
00:02:57.786 --> 00:02:59.867
"Is this World X?"

57
00:03:00.207 --> 00:03:00.828
Gliss asked.

58
00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.181
"I believe so.

59
00:03:03.802 --> 00:03:06.464
Look!" Wyssa snapped her fingers.

60
00:03:07.325 --> 00:03:10.887
Dozens of wormholes instantly winked into sight all around them!

61
00:03:12.028 --> 00:03:13.770
Zann glanced into the nearest one.

62
00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.932
"That is so weird.

63
00:03:16.612 --> 00:03:18.153
I don't see the vortex at all.

64
00:03:18.634 --> 00:03:19.815
Just a bunch of trees."

65
00:03:19.835 --> 00:03:22.837
"I see a dragon through this one!"

66
00:03:23.177 --> 00:03:23.698
Gliss said.

67
00:03:23.718 --> 00:03:25.299
"It's true!"

68
00:03:25.699 --> 00:03:26.760
Perda looked awed.

69
00:03:27.381 --> 00:03:30.864
"The wormholes here lead directly into other worlds."

70
00:03:32.076 --> 00:03:33.277
"Wow." Darb said.

71
00:03:33.297 --> 00:03:37.381
"So we could step straight back into Magica if we found the right wormhole?"

72
00:03:38.822 --> 00:03:40.764
"Yes!" Gliss sounded excited.

73
00:03:40.784 --> 00:03:42.946
"I wonder how we could find it?"

74
00:03:43.907 --> 00:03:44.768
Zann ignored them.

75
00:03:45.308 --> 00:03:46.309
"So where's Morb?"

76
00:03:46.529 --> 00:03:47.370
he asked Wyssa.

77
00:03:48.311 --> 00:03:49.412
"How do you know he's here?"

78
00:03:49.432 --> 00:03:52.314
"I have my ways."

79
00:03:52.795 --> 00:03:53.696
Wyssa looked grim.

80
00:03:54.684 --> 00:04:00.766
"When I find him, I'm going to drag him straight through to Fardark, where I'll feed him to

81
00:04:00.806 --> 00:04:03.266
the first scatter beast I find!"

82
00:04:04.627 --> 00:04:07.888
Zann gulped, thinking back to his time in Fardark.

83
00:04:08.728 --> 00:04:11.729
For a second he almost felt sorry for Morb.

84
00:04:12.669 --> 00:04:16.270
Almost. Just then a tiny man hurried into view.

85
00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.831
"Wyssa!" he exclaimed.

86
00:04:18.851 --> 00:04:20.411
"I have news."

87
00:04:21.491 --> 00:04:23.992
He stopped short when he noticed Zann and the others.

88
00:04:25.124 --> 00:04:26.585
"Oh, you have company."

89
00:04:26.605 --> 00:04:29.707
"Never mind them," Wyssa said.

90
00:04:29.727 --> 00:04:32.668
"Tell me what you know, Whistlefeather.

91
00:04:33.129 --> 00:04:33.789
Is he here?"

92
00:04:33.809 --> 00:04:37.271
"Yes," Whistlefeather said fearfully.

93
00:04:37.291 --> 00:04:40.293
"Morb is indeed here in Rood.

94
00:04:40.793 --> 00:04:43.755
And we've heard that he's brought prisoners from Magica with him!"

95
00:04:43.775 --> 00:04:45.976
"Prisoners from Magica?"

96
00:04:46.336 --> 00:04:47.176
Zann blurted out.

97
00:04:47.196 --> 00:04:49.538
"That's got to be my parents!"

98
00:04:50.478 --> 00:04:51.699
He grabbed Wyssa's sleeve.

99
00:04:51.719 --> 00:04:53.160
"We have to find them!"

100
00:04:54.304 --> 00:04:57.466
"Thank you, my friend," Wyssa said to Whistlefeather.

101
00:04:58.387 --> 00:04:59.667
She shook off Zann's hand.

102
00:05:00.588 --> 00:05:03.590
Then, snapping her fingers, she zapped out of sight.

103
00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.092
"No!" Zann cried.

104
00:05:06.112 --> 00:05:07.973
"It's okay, Zann."

105
00:05:08.253 --> 00:05:09.614
Perda reached into her pocket.

106
00:05:09.634 --> 00:05:12.516
"We still have this, remember?"

107
00:05:13.516 --> 00:05:18.499
Zann and his friends barely had time to grab one another before they were whisked off again by

108
00:05:18.539 --> 00:05:19.240
Mother's spell.

109
00:05:20.012 --> 00:05:25.053
They flew through the forest and up a steep hill before coming to an abrupt stop at a

110
00:05:25.093 --> 00:05:25.854
wall of rocks.

111
00:05:25.874 --> 00:05:27.914
"You again!"

112
00:05:28.214 --> 00:05:30.055
Wyssa didn't seem pleased to see them.

113
00:05:30.995 --> 00:05:32.535
"Hush, or he'll hear us."

114
00:05:33.856 --> 00:05:34.976
Zann glanced around.

115
00:05:35.816 --> 00:05:40.618
The rocks led to a gorge, on the other side of which was a massive waterfall.

116
00:05:41.518 --> 00:05:44.279
Over the roar of the water, he could hear voices.

117
00:05:45.259 --> 00:05:47.719
Zann peeked over the rocks and gasped.

118
00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.480
It was Morb!

119
00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.440
"Keep your head down!"

120
00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:52.361
Wyssa hissed.

121
00:05:53.421 --> 00:05:56.822
Another person stood between the evil villain and the edge of the cliff.

122
00:05:56.842 --> 00:06:01.003
"Oh!" Gliss whispered, peering out beside Zann.

123
00:06:01.023 --> 00:06:03.063
"Is that Venna?"

124
00:06:04.224 --> 00:06:07.205
Venna was staring at Morb, looking terrified.

125
00:06:07.225 --> 00:06:09.425
"You can't do this!"

126
00:06:09.725 --> 00:06:10.185
she cried.

127
00:06:10.205 --> 00:06:11.926
"It's not right!"

128
00:06:12.846 --> 00:06:15.647
Morb lifted a hand and rubbed his fingers together.

129
00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:20.940
"I'm the one who decides what's right around here," he sneered.

130
00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.981
"Now prepare to go for a little swim."

131
00:06:26.242 --> 00:06:29.022
Venna glanced fearfully down at the water behind her.

132
00:06:29.042 --> 00:06:33.384
"No—p-please," she stammered.

133
00:06:33.404 --> 00:06:36.284
"Why is she so scared?"

134
00:06:36.664 --> 00:06:37.325
Perda whispered.

135
00:06:37.345 --> 00:06:41.526
"She must still not have magic," said Gliss.

136
00:06:41.546 --> 00:06:45.027
"But she doesn't need magic to swim."

137
00:06:45.907 --> 00:06:48.027
Perda sidled closer to the cliff's edge.

138
00:06:48.868 --> 00:06:52.446
When she looked down, she saw why Venna was so scared.

139
00:06:52.466 --> 00:06:54.528
"Oh no!"

140
00:06:55.869 --> 00:06:58.331
"What?" Zann moved over to peer down as well.

141
00:06:58.351 --> 00:07:01.814
"Oh, wow—is that a gulper?"

142
00:07:01.834 --> 00:07:07.159
"I guess now we know why Morb went to Skellia," Darb said grimly.

143
00:07:07.179 --> 00:07:09.341
"You have to stop him!"

144
00:07:09.681 --> 00:07:10.722
Zann urged Wyssa.

145
00:07:11.222 --> 00:07:12.584
"You have to save Venna!"

146
00:07:13.404 --> 00:07:14.385
But it was too late.

147
00:07:14.866 --> 00:07:17.167
Just then Morb snapped his fingers.

148
00:07:18.169 --> 00:07:25.767
Venna screamed as magic energy shot from Morb's hand, sending her tumbling down into the gulper's waiting jaws!
